1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:06,228
We added an AI reviewer to save
developers time.

2
00:00:06,428 --> 00:00:11,538
First pull request: three hundred
suggestions.

3
00:00:11,738 --> 00:00:16,701
And some were really good!

4
00:00:16,901 --> 00:00:21,864
So the coding agent fixed them.

5
00:00:22,064 --> 00:00:27,027
Three hundred fixes.

6
00:00:27,227 --> 00:00:32,190
Then the reviewer reviewed the
fixes.

7
00:00:32,390 --> 00:00:37,352
More suggestions!

8
00:00:37,552 --> 00:00:42,515
One agent renamed a function.

9
00:00:42,715 --> 00:00:47,678
The other wanted a clearer name.

10
00:00:47,878 --> 00:00:53,047
They discussed it all morning.
Through commits!

11
00:00:53,247 --> 00:00:58,210
Every commit started a pipeline.

12
00:00:58,410 --> 00:01:03,373
Our tests run in ninety seconds.

13
00:01:03,573 --> 00:01:08,536
We spent months optimizing them.

14
00:01:08,736 --> 00:01:13,699
Ninety seconds!

15
00:01:13,899 --> 00:01:18,862
After six hours waiting for a
runner.

16
00:01:19,062 --> 00:01:24,025
At nine, all the developers logged
in.

17
00:01:24,225 --> 00:01:29,188
Each one started five agents.

18
00:01:29,388 --> 00:01:34,498
The runners were fully booked before
stand-up.

19
00:01:34,698 --> 00:01:39,661
So we doubled the runners.

20
00:01:39,861 --> 00:01:44,824
The queue started moving!

21
00:01:45,024 --> 00:01:49,987
The agents got feedback faster!

22
00:01:50,187 --> 00:01:55,150
And immediately submitted more
fixes.

23
00:01:55,350 --> 00:02:00,313
We'd upgraded the traffic jam.

24
00:02:00,513 --> 00:02:05,476
Then we added an autoscaler.

25
00:02:05,676 --> 00:02:10,962
Finally, something could keep up
with the agents.

26
00:02:11,162 --> 00:02:16,125
The cloud bill.

27
00:02:16,325 --> 00:02:21,288
And the human reviewers? Still
there!

28
00:02:21,488 --> 00:02:26,451
Someone has to check the AI's
suggestions.

29
00:02:26,651 --> 00:02:31,761
Now they read the code, the review,
the fix...

30
00:02:31,961 --> 00:02:36,924
And the review of the fix.

31
00:02:37,124 --> 00:02:42,352
We automated everything except
understanding it.

32
00:02:42,552 --> 00:02:47,779
Finance asked us to reduce
infrastructure costs.

33
00:02:47,979 --> 00:02:52,942
No problem. The agent wrote a patch.

34
00:02:53,142 --> 00:02:58,311
Beautiful patch. Turns off
unnecessary runners.

35
00:02:58,511 --> 00:03:03,474
Did we deploy it? Not yet.

36
00:03:03,674 --> 00:03:08,637
It's waiting for a runner.

37
00:03:08,837 --> 00:03:13,800
And the AI reviewer has a few
suggestions.
